{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the early 1900s, all communication with the remote Eilean Mor lighthouse off the coast of Scotland was cut off.\u00a0</strong>The light no longer shines at night. No one is answering the radio. And the three lighthouse keepers have vanished without a trace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a reserve lighthouse keeper, sent to investigate the silence. What begins as a simple relief mission soon descends into a psychological horror experience one rooted in isolation, madness, and a mystery buried deep within the island.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871570/extras/92f4c90f83114fa73ce73f0c8d6a50f2.poster.avif?t=1768475742\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871570/extras/92f4c90f83114fa73ce73f0c8d6a50f2.webm?t=1768475742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871570/extras/92f4c90f83114fa73ce73f0c8d6a50f2.mp4?t=1768475742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871570/extras/d96f3cbdbce542e535af1ba186642e0b.poster.avif?t=1768475742\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871570/extras/d96f3cbdbce542e535af1ba186642e0b.webm?t=1768475742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871570/extras/d96f3cbdbce542e535af1ba186642e0b.mp4?t=1768475742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dark halls, uncover cryptic clues, and survive the haunting atmosphere of Eilean Mor in this story-rich, first-person horror adventure. As the fog thickens and reality begins to unravel, you must uncover the truth before you too disappear into the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871570/extras/t\u00fcnel?t=1768475742\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REAL STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>James D., Thomas M., Donald M.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In December of the year 1900\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three men were stationed on the island of <strong>Eilean M\u00f2r</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And on December 7th, they sent their final signal to the outside world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then\u2026 darkness fell. And the lighthouse\u2026 was never lit again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For 19 days, there was no sign, no trace. Until Joseph M. the relief keeper, set foot on the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What he found was more terrifying than silence. There was no sign of life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lighthouse was abandoned. And inside\u2026 only a logbook remained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&quot;The strongest wind I\u2019ve seen in 20 years. Head Keeper James Ducat. has gone quiet, and the third assistant McArthur is crying.&quot;</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the records show\u2026 there was no storm that day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So\u2026 what was it that drove three seasoned men to tears in fear?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What could have pulled them outside\u2026 into the cold\u2026 without even taking their coats?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 1900, at an ordinary lighthouse\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something extraordinary happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready... for the terror?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871570/extras/09cb6d80bfd56a253d268c3c5491ed6c.poster.avif?t=1768475742\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871570/extras/09cb6d80bfd56a253d268c3c5491ed6c.webm?t=1768475742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871570/extras/09cb6d80bfd56a253d268c3c5491ed6c.mp4?t=1768475742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THEME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story in the game is inspired and adapted from a real event.It takes place at a lighthouse located on a remote island. The island and lighthouse are designed based on a real-world location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871570/extras/a33b936c474b2dfac3fedcf671952316.poster.avif?t=1768475742\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871570/extras/a33b936c474b2dfac3fedcf671952316.webm?t=1768475742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871570/extras/a33b936c474b2dfac3fedcf671952316.mp4?t=1768475742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a single-player, first-person horror and thriller game.<br>Don\u2019t forget that you need to follow certain clues to progress in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871570/extras/ac4cbca628a72eaa658fd058cd05b0df.poster.avif?t=1768475742\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871570/extras/ac4cbca628a72eaa658fd058cd05b0df.webm?t=1768475742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871570/extras/ac4cbca628a72eaa658fd058cd05b0df.mp4?t=1768475742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will try to unravel the island\u2019s mystery through radio communication and environmental interactions, supported by light simulation mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by a true event and fictionalized. The locations and the lives of the characters in the game have been carefully designed to resemble reality as closely as possible. However, some historical elements in the story have been altered to enhance the dramatic effect and improve the player\u2019s experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONTENT WARNING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game contains jump scares, disturbing atmospheres, and psychological horror elements.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871570/extras/8a07fb95d2eef020987b6980f01e4f1b.poster.avif?t=1768475742\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871570/extras/8a07fb95d2eef020987b6980f01e4f1b.webm?t=1768475742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871570/extras/8a07fb95d2eef020987b6980f01e4f1b.mp4?t=1768475742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is <strong>not recommended for individuals with heart conditions, a history of epilepsy, or those who are pregnant.\u00a0</strong>Please proceed with caution while playing.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3871570?t=1768475742","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871570/411db9b6024c6d652ebbd44f69fbd8c190c722c6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768475742","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871570/64d76a035068bb7e43add9a459a9b9c67664f936/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768475742","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871570/64d76a035068bb7e43add9a459a9b9c67664f936/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768475742","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains jump scares, disturbing atmospheres, and psychological horror elements.\r\nIt is not recommended for individuals with heart conditions, a history of epilepsy, or those who are pregnant. Please proceed with caution while playing."},"demos":[{"appid":4014360,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the early 1900s, all communication with the remote Eilean Mor lighthouse off the coast of Scotland was cut off.\u00a0</strong>The light no longer shines at night. No one is answering the radio. And the three lighthouse keepers have vanished without a trace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a reserve lighthouse keeper, sent to investigate the silence. What begins as a simple relief mission soon descends into a psychological horror experience one rooted in isolation, madness, and a mystery buried deep within the island.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871570/extras/92f4c90f83114fa73ce73f0c8d6a50f2.poster.avif?t=1768475742\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871570/extras/92f4c90f83114fa7