ef keeper, set foot on the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What he found was more terrifying than silence. There was no sign of life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lighthouse was abandoned. And inside\u2026 only a logbook remained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&quot;The strongest wind I\u2019ve seen in 20 years. Head Keeper James Ducat. has gone quiet, and the third assistant McArthur is crying.&quot;</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the records show\u2026 there was no storm that day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So\u2026 what was it that drove three seasoned men to tears in fear?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What could have pulled them outside\u2026 into the cold\u2026 without even taking their coats?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 1900, at an ordinary lighthouse\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something extraordinary happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready... for the terror?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871570/extras/09cb6d80bfd56a253d268c3c5491ed6c.poster.avif?t=1768475742\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871570/extras/09cb6d80bfd56a253d268c3c5491ed6c.webm?t=1768475742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871570/extras/09cb6d80bfd56a253d268c3c5491ed6c.mp4?t=1768475742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THEME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story in the game is inspired and adapted from a real event.It takes place at a lighthouse located on a remote island. The island and lighthouse are designed based on a real-world location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=