<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game contains jump scares, disturbing atmospheres, and psychological horror elements.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871570/extras/8a07fb95d2eef020987b6980f01e4f1b.poster.avif?t=1768475742\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871570/extras/8a07fb95d2eef020987b6980f01e4f1b.webm?t=1768475742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871570/extras/8a07fb95d2eef020987b6980f01e4f1b.mp4?t=1768475742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is <strong>not recommended for individuals with heart conditions, a history of epilepsy, or those who are pregnant.\u00a0</strong>Please proceed with caution while playing.</p>","developers":["Dead Witness"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871570/2e019b5362f26e030bb4c715909879e2abcfce16/header.jpg?t=1768475742","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3871570/1907248362/2b27d8f7b62afcf9a1c2fe790476ebaa4b7818e1/1756148919/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760387281","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3871570/1907248362/2b27d8f7b62afcf9a1c2fe790476ebaa4b7818e1/1756148919/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760387281","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3871570/1907248362/2b27d8f7b62afcf9a1c2fe790476ebaa4b7818e1/1756148919/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760387281","id":257188695,"name":"Eilean Mor The Lost Keepers Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app